```

Note the security gate: `@PreAuthorize("hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)")`. (There is a `v2` controller `OwnerRestControllerV2`, but it only implements `GET /api/owners` paging via `OwnerV2Api.listOwnersPage`; it does not handle POST.)

## 3. The DTO + ALL Bean Validation annotations

